WEBVTT

01:40.500 --> 01:44.170
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.110 --> 01:47.150
[Episode 18]

01:48.120 --> 01:48.920
Here.

01:50.539 --> 01:51.509
This wine is really good.

01:51.560 --> 01:52.710
We have wine and meat here.

01:52.710 --> 01:53.860
What's the special occasion today?

01:53.880 --> 01:55.610
Of course, it's the day we're starting to renovate the house.

01:55.710 --> 01:56.509
No.

01:57.850 --> 02:00.690
Today is the day of our engagement.

02:02.360 --> 02:03.600
So, the date is set?

02:03.870 --> 02:04.680
Yes.

02:04.950 --> 02:05.560
Today,

02:05.560 --> 02:06.950
I went to Liu the Blind for a fortune-telling.

02:06.970 --> 02:08.960
The 9th of next month is an auspicious day.

02:09.240 --> 02:11.430
So I plan to

02:11.770 --> 02:13.050
marry Yunniang on that day.

02:13.590 --> 02:14.750
That's wonderful!

02:14.840 --> 02:16.710
Isn't it just a few days away?

02:16.980 --> 02:17.790
That's right.

02:17.960 --> 02:18.680
Yes.

02:18.680 --> 02:19.590
Just a few days.

02:20.430 --> 02:21.800
Before we start,

02:21.890 --> 02:24.600
I'd like to say something.

02:26.710 --> 02:29.310
I have no father, no mother,

02:29.400 --> 02:31.120
and my foster father, my only family, has passed away.

02:31.600 --> 02:33.520
Yunniang's family is also gone.

02:33.840 --> 02:35.470
Although you've only just arrived recently,

02:35.670 --> 02:36.590
and we had

02:37.030 --> 02:38.579
some misunderstandings when we first met,

02:39.850 --> 02:41.890
over these past few days,

02:42.010 --> 02:43.520
we've gotten along like long-time friends.

02:43.870 --> 02:45.240
Since everyone's here today,

02:45.590 --> 02:47.430
I'd like to ask you to be my witnesses.

02:47.680 --> 02:48.400
Okay!

02:53.840 --> 02:54.630
Yunniang.

02:58.030 --> 02:58.840
Yunniang.

03:00.490 --> 03:03.000
From now on,

03:03.030 --> 03:04.190
we'll be living together.

03:04.310 --> 03:05.630
Thank you for not minding my poverty.

03:06.040 --> 03:06.990
I know

03:07.240 --> 03:08.310
I have

03:08.470 --> 03:10.120
all sorts of flaws.

03:10.710 --> 03:12.280
But I have

03:12.800 --> 03:13.630
a true heart that

03:13.630 --> 03:15.240
I'm not afraid to show you.

03:15.840 --> 03:17.280
I won't say much about the future.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.280
You'll see for yourself.

03:18.430 --> 03:21.030
I will definitely work hard to protect you,

03:21.030 --> 03:21.750
to stay by your side,

03:21.910 --> 03:23.400
and take care of you for the rest of my life.

03:23.680 --> 03:24.470
Yunniang,

03:24.870 --> 03:27.310
if you have any requests for me,

03:27.310 --> 03:28.240
just say them.

03:28.240 --> 03:29.430
I'm sure I can fulfill them.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.360
I don't have any requests for you.

03:31.870 --> 03:32.630
It's just that the last time,

03:32.630 --> 03:33.840
when I married that unlucky guy,

03:33.840 --> 03:35.360
he passed away before I even

03:35.360 --> 03:36.360
stepped into his house.

03:36.590 --> 03:37.710
Really disappointing.

03:37.710 --> 03:38.990
He left me a widow for no reason.

03:39.480 --> 03:40.320
So,

03:40.870 --> 03:42.360
I only have one request for you.

03:43.420 --> 03:44.230
Pei Jiu,

03:44.579 --> 03:45.910
you must live a long life

03:46.360 --> 03:48.079
and stay with me through this lifetime.

03:50.240 --> 03:51.030
Okay.

03:52.520 --> 03:53.800
Let's all have a drink together!

03:53.840 --> 03:54.630
Come on.

03:54.630 --> 03:56.630
Wish you a long life and a happy marriage.

03:56.710 --> 03:57.800
May you have children soon.

03:58.190 --> 03:59.000
May you stay safe.

03:59.640 --> 04:00.450
Thank you, everyone.

04:03.710 --> 04:04.400
Cool!

04:04.400 --> 04:04.910
It's really good!

04:04.910 --> 04:05.630
Jiu,

04:05.840 --> 04:06.560
today, you should have

04:06.560 --> 04:07.710
invited your master.

04:08.080 --> 04:09.150
Where is Mr. Yuan?

04:10.310 --> 04:11.590
Yuanzhong has already eaten,

04:12.280 --> 04:13.280
so he's not coming.

04:18.480 --> 04:19.950
How about I make a new set of furniture

04:19.950 --> 04:20.950
as a gift for you two?

04:21.510 --> 04:23.000
Tables, chairs,

04:23.070 --> 04:24.310
and baby beds—

04:24.510 --> 04:26.040
just tell me anything you like,

04:26.040 --> 04:26.800
and I can make it

04:26.800 --> 04:27.680
for you.

04:27.800 --> 04:29.360
That's wonderful! Thank you.

04:30.270 --> 04:31.070
Come on, come on.

04:31.140 --> 04:31.940
Let's have a drink!

04:31.960 --> 04:33.250
If I don't drink you under the table today,

04:33.360 --> 04:34.120
I won't call myself Kai Shan anymore.

04:34.120 --> 04:35.040
Congratulations.

04:35.190 --> 04:36.430
If you put it that way,

04:36.430 --> 04:37.720
do you think you can outdrink me?

04:47.070 --> 04:49.480
Mr. Tanghua, have you ever been to Yandu?

04:50.310 --> 04:51.120
Never.

04:51.920 --> 04:52.950
This is my first time seeing

04:52.950 --> 04:54.800
such a big, bustling city of the human race.

04:55.190 --> 04:56.000
Yandu...

04:56.390 --> 04:58.310
seems like a city that appeared out of nowhere.

04:59.480 --> 05:00.560
Appeared out of nowhere?

05:00.560 --> 05:01.310
That's right.

05:02.120 --> 05:03.950
When it first appeared in the history books of the human race,

05:04.040 --> 05:05.480
it was already a city.

05:05.950 --> 05:07.480
According to my people's historical records,

05:07.680 --> 05:09.480
this place was originally surrounded by steep mountains,

05:09.480 --> 05:10.560
with dangerous terrain,

05:11.120 --> 05:13.120
and was a desolate area.

05:13.600 --> 05:14.630
But one day,

05:14.920 --> 05:16.310
a passing merchant caravan

05:16.390 --> 05:17.240
suddenly discovered

05:17.240 --> 05:18.720
that a city had appeared here.

05:20.270 --> 05:21.680
The news of this city's appearance

05:21.680 --> 05:23.120
quickly spread.

05:23.390 --> 05:24.800
While the world was shocked,

05:24.920 --> 05:26.630
everyone wanted to claim it for themselves.

05:27.070 --> 05:27.870
Back then,

05:28.070 --> 05:29.270
Chenshang Kingdom and Qiong Kingdom

05:29.270 --> 05:31.120
fought a long and drawn-out war

05:31.270 --> 05:32.070
over the ownership

05:32.070 --> 05:33.510
of Yandu,

05:34.070 --> 05:36.270
but neither side could claim victory.

05:36.880 --> 05:38.390
It wasn't until the war between gods and demons,

05:38.930 --> 05:41.240
when the flames of war from the Divine Realm spread to the Mortal Realm,

05:41.310 --> 05:42.560
that it came to an end.

05:43.600 --> 05:44.870
After the Battle of Pinghu,

05:44.870 --> 05:46.120
the human race finally realized

05:46.120 --> 05:47.430
the importance of unity.

05:48.360 --> 05:49.560
Although people are still divided into different countries,

05:49.630 --> 05:50.950
there is little conflict now,

05:51.800 --> 05:53.510
and Yandu has become completely independent,

05:54.070 --> 05:55.159
turning into

05:55.159 --> 05:56.720
the bustling city of trade it is today.

05:57.720 --> 05:58.480
The Scholar's Wall,

05:58.480 --> 05:59.920
tool shops, and the Craftsmanship Museum

05:59.920 --> 06:01.240
are all unique features of Yandu.

06:02.240 --> 06:03.190
You really know a lot

06:03.190 --> 06:04.400
about Yandu.

06:04.510 --> 06:06.360
I was born here, so naturally, I know.

06:08.070 --> 06:09.870
Are you here in Yandu on business?

06:11.190 --> 06:12.000
No, just sightseeing.

06:13.310 --> 06:14.950
I heard that since the Craftsmanship Museum

06:15.310 --> 06:17.310
came under the management of the Merchant Association,

06:17.600 --> 06:19.190
they've started charging an entrance fee.

06:19.590 --> 06:20.420
I was thinking of

06:20.450 --> 06:21.860
going there in the next few days to take a look.

06:22.630 --> 06:24.480
How much is the entrance fee?

06:24.680 --> 06:25.590
I don't know about that.

06:26.240 --> 06:27.070
These

06:27.510 --> 06:29.240
are usually handled by Jiuguang and others.

06:30.680 --> 06:31.480
Right.

06:31.920 --> 06:33.310
Sir, you have a noble background

06:33.480 --> 06:34.560
and refined taste.

06:34.950 --> 06:36.800
How could you care about such trivial matters?

06:37.310 --> 06:39.360
I heard that you are fond of poetry and calligraphy.

06:39.800 --> 06:40.800
It is said that

06:40.920 --> 06:42.630
when Master Xu passed by the Scholar's Wall,

06:42.630 --> 06:43.680
he also left an inscription on it.

06:44.070 --> 06:45.270
Have you seen it?

06:46.230 --> 06:48.540
There are so many inscriptions on the Scholar's Wall.

06:49.100 --> 06:50.470
I didn't notice it.

06:56.470 --> 06:58.640
Sir, why do you seem so guarded around me?

07:01.320 --> 07:02.120
Could it be...

07:06.040 --> 07:07.160
I just don't understand

07:08.630 --> 07:10.390
why I didn't notice a girl like you

07:11.070 --> 07:12.950
when you were interested in me.

07:14.600 --> 07:16.310
Your heart wasn't with me,

07:16.880 --> 07:18.230
so of course, you didn't see me.

07:19.070 --> 07:20.510
Now I've noticed you,

07:20.920 --> 07:22.840
but your heart is no longer with me.

07:27.160 --> 07:28.070
Before you came,

07:28.680 --> 07:30.560
I had already visited that restaurant for 7 consecutive days.

07:31.120 --> 07:32.510
I joked with Jiuguang,

07:32.830 --> 07:34.000
saying I was fishing.

07:34.720 --> 07:35.680
During those 7 days,

07:36.270 --> 07:37.750
I thought of several possibilities.

07:38.480 --> 07:39.270
I even thought that the one coming

07:39.270 --> 07:40.680
could be a War Demon

07:41.000 --> 07:42.680
or some kind of warlock from the martial world.

07:43.190 --> 07:44.630
But I never expected

07:45.240 --> 07:46.360
that it would be you—

07:47.270 --> 07:49.159
Young Mistress Dai of Yandu City.

07:50.000 --> 07:50.800
How...

07:51.720 --> 07:52.830
How did I know?

07:54.750 --> 07:56.040
You hide your identity but not your name,

07:56.190 --> 07:57.390
so it's easy to inquire about you.

07:57.830 --> 07:59.000
In Yandu City,

07:59.040 --> 07:59.830
your name is well known

07:59.830 --> 08:01.270
even to children.

08:01.600 --> 08:02.870
I'm not your enemy.

08:02.890 --> 08:03.720
You are not?

08:04.190 --> 08:05.390
I don't think so.

08:06.070 --> 08:07.480
Back then, when the war first broke out,

08:07.680 --> 08:09.120
my people charged into battle,

08:09.360 --> 08:11.360
while the human race sat back and watched from the sidelines.

08:11.620 --> 08:13.010
I can never forget this grudge.

08:13.560 --> 08:14.310
If it weren't for the War Demons later

08:14.310 --> 08:16.310
launching a massive invasion of human cities,

08:16.590 --> 08:18.470
burning and killing fiercely

08:19.040 --> 08:20.920
the human race wouldn't have sought an alliance with my people.

08:20.950 --> 08:21.720
But our two races

08:21.720 --> 08:22.830
did ally in the end.

08:22.830 --> 08:23.870
So what?

08:24.480 --> 08:25.950
If the roles were reversed now,

08:26.800 --> 08:28.510
and the War Demons were the ones

08:28.510 --> 08:29.750
hiding and barely surviving,

08:30.320 --> 08:31.930
what choice would the human race make?

08:32.200 --> 08:33.240
Don't you believe

08:33.240 --> 08:34.960
in moderation and balance the most?

08:36.000 --> 08:38.320
Humans are truly strange.

08:38.600 --> 08:39.909
Though weak,

08:40.080 --> 08:41.440
you still persist and thrive.

08:41.840 --> 08:43.080
When there's no external enemy,

08:43.240 --> 08:45.000
you fight among yourselves,

08:45.120 --> 08:47.000
destroying the peace and prosperity with your own hands.

08:47.390 --> 08:48.440
But when an enemy appears,

08:48.600 --> 08:50.320
you can immediately unite

08:50.910 --> 08:52.510
and create extraordinary miracles.

08:52.960 --> 08:53.750
Over the past 60 years,

08:53.750 --> 08:55.200
while the War Demons vanished without a trace,

08:55.870 --> 08:57.520
who has been

08:58.240 --> 08:59.280
holding you together?

09:00.240 --> 09:01.960
Humans are always wavering.

09:02.200 --> 09:04.030
Now that the War Demons are returning,

09:04.270 --> 09:05.910
you are wavering again,

09:06.380 --> 09:07.170
aren't you?

09:07.390 --> 09:08.200
So?

09:08.870 --> 09:09.720
You suspect my people have colluded

09:09.720 --> 09:11.320
with the remnants of the War Demons, don't you?

09:11.510 --> 09:13.000
Shouldn't I?

09:13.200 --> 09:14.560
If you want to disassociate yourselves from it,

09:14.590 --> 09:16.030
just provide solid proof.

09:16.360 --> 09:17.720
What's the deal with Lyu Yao?

09:17.910 --> 09:19.650
And what about the Green Garden Trading House?

09:19.790 --> 09:20.870
And the Wushuang Society?

09:21.200 --> 09:23.150
Can you disassociate yourselves from all of them?

09:23.270 --> 09:24.080
I can.

09:24.440 --> 09:25.320
Trust me.

09:25.790 --> 09:26.600
Trust you?

09:28.270 --> 09:29.750
The Young Mistress of Yandu City,

09:30.100 --> 09:32.010
with such noble status,

09:32.720 --> 09:34.840
second only to the emperor,

09:35.080 --> 09:36.080
is undoubtedly

09:36.080 --> 09:37.200
the cream of the crop.

09:37.260 --> 09:39.180
Yet this noble person

09:40.080 --> 09:41.510
willingly went to Fangwai Mountain

09:41.510 --> 09:43.180
and became a humble handmaiden,

09:43.720 --> 09:45.440
remaining so for 10 years.

09:46.200 --> 09:47.390
And it was actually

09:48.150 --> 09:49.480
because of me.

09:50.550 --> 09:51.750
Listen to yourself.

09:52.200 --> 09:53.870
Which of these words is believable?

09:54.240 --> 09:55.720
How do you expect me to believe that?

09:58.270 --> 09:59.240
I'm such a fool,

10:00.270 --> 10:01.750
to come here full of guilt

10:02.180 --> 10:03.660
over something like this.

10:04.720 --> 10:05.840
It's truly laughable.

10:11.320 --> 10:12.080
You can suspect

10:12.080 --> 10:13.510
that my people are involved in this matter,

10:14.240 --> 10:15.080
but you cannot doubt

10:15.080 --> 10:15.910
my feelings for you

10:15.910 --> 10:17.120
over the past few decades,

10:18.320 --> 10:19.960
even though they no longer exist now.

10:22.000 --> 10:23.030
You're right.

10:24.080 --> 10:26.600
We are indeed good at clever planning.

10:27.120 --> 10:27.910
Of course,

10:27.960 --> 10:28.750
in your eyes,

10:28.750 --> 10:30.270
it might just be scheming and trickery.

10:32.320 --> 10:33.670
In my ten years on the mountain,

10:34.320 --> 10:35.600
I've seen enough of your people

10:35.960 --> 10:38.000
fighting to the death over conflicts,

10:38.390 --> 10:39.120
and I've also seen

10:39.120 --> 10:40.630
how you've struggled

10:40.870 --> 10:42.060
and strived

10:42.260 --> 10:43.330
in difficult situations.

10:44.720 --> 10:45.510
Tanghua,

10:46.600 --> 10:48.600
with how well I know you and how much attention I've paid to you,

10:49.080 --> 10:50.360
if I wanted to harm you,

10:50.830 --> 10:51.970
you would have been dead long ago.

11:04.910 --> 11:06.200
This wine is really good.

11:06.200 --> 11:07.870
I'll drink this again next time.

11:07.870 --> 11:09.120
Of course.

11:10.480 --> 11:11.320
Let me tell you,

11:11.720 --> 11:14.000
I like you this way.

11:14.300 --> 11:15.620
I like you too.

11:16.000 --> 11:18.550
You're different from Master and Zi Fei.

11:18.550 --> 11:20.150
They seem to be full of tricks,

11:20.150 --> 11:20.600
you know?

11:20.600 --> 11:21.630
Alright, alright, alright.

11:21.720 --> 11:23.000
Jiu, Jiu,

11:23.000 --> 11:23.790
look at me.

11:23.810 --> 11:25.090
I've arrived at my place. Go home now.

11:26.120 --> 11:27.750
I'll listen to you.

11:27.750 --> 11:28.440
Okay.

11:29.250 --> 11:30.610
Let go of me.

11:30.880 --> 11:32.160
I won't see you off.

11:32.600 --> 11:33.390
I won't see you off.

11:33.870 --> 11:34.660
Go back.

11:35.600 --> 11:36.440
I won't see you off.

11:37.410 --> 11:38.890
I'll go home.

11:39.190 --> 11:40.710
Where's my home again?

11:41.320 --> 11:43.440
It must be the way back.

11:43.640 --> 11:44.430
Over there.

11:47.550 --> 11:49.960
Are you totally wasted?

11:50.160 --> 11:52.640
I've been having a bad memory lately.

11:52.860 --> 11:54.650
Oh, my brain.

11:54.840 --> 11:56.720
I even forgot what the Governor looked like

11:57.030 --> 11:59.600
when I went to the government office earlier today.

12:00.360 --> 12:02.280
I told you your brain's not working well.

12:02.300 --> 12:03.770
Your brain's not working well!

12:05.000 --> 12:05.960
I'm leaving.

12:06.240 --> 12:06.750
Okay.

12:06.750 --> 12:08.630
I won't see you off.

12:09.030 --> 12:09.840
Take care.

12:09.840 --> 12:10.480
Alright.

12:10.630 --> 12:11.670
Be careful on your way.

12:13.140 --> 12:14.500
He's drunk.

12:21.410 --> 12:26.910
[Yesterday's Inn]

12:25.360 --> 12:27.080
The wine from Lu Chen was really good.

12:27.080 --> 12:27.840
I told you those two

12:27.840 --> 12:29.150
couldn't drink that much.

12:31.320 --> 12:32.110
Wake up.

12:32.270 --> 12:33.720
Is there a person over there?

12:34.120 --> 12:35.080
What person?

12:42.200 --> 12:43.510
Mr. Yuan, are you taking a walk to help with digestion?

12:48.060 --> 12:48.850
Ji Tanyin.

12:50.960 --> 12:51.750
Where did you go?

12:52.790 --> 12:53.720
I'm going back to my room to sleep.

12:53.720 --> 12:55.480
I'm asking you where you went just now.

12:55.910 --> 12:57.660
Where did I go just now?

12:59.420 --> 13:00.900
My memory hasn't been good lately.

13:01.270 --> 13:02.790
Why don't you go ask Zi Fei?

13:03.360 --> 13:04.410
Come with me.

13:21.630 --> 13:22.790
It's dark

13:23.150 --> 13:24.120
and cold here,

13:25.480 --> 13:26.480
and there's no one around.

13:27.480 --> 13:29.320
Why are we here?

13:30.360 --> 13:31.910
I always feel that something's off here.

13:35.030 --> 13:36.100
What's off?

13:36.440 --> 13:37.360
Lately, I've been constantly feeling

13:37.360 --> 13:38.360
tightness in my chest.

13:38.480 --> 13:39.320
I suspect

13:39.550 --> 13:40.720
it's related to the strange sensation I felt

13:40.720 --> 13:42.120
when I transferred my power to Lu Chen that day.

13:42.870 --> 13:43.960
You stay here and keep watch for me,

13:43.960 --> 13:45.200
and I'll go down to investigate.

13:51.390 --> 13:52.600
Did you hear me, Ji Tanyin?

14:49.950 --> 14:52.740
♫Too many old dreams♫

14:53.310 --> 14:56.320
♫Where did the snow fall to?♫

14:53.360 --> 14:54.720
The landlady said

14:55.270 --> 14:56.910
it's not appropriate to enter

14:56.910 --> 14:58.790
a man's home barefoot.

14:57.460 --> 15:00.860
♫Going to face a catastrophe♫

15:01.030 --> 15:03.860
♫No one is irrelevant♫

15:02.200 --> 15:03.390
You're not barefoot.

15:04.080 --> 15:05.150
You have your shoes on.

15:06.270 --> 15:07.390
The landlady said

15:07.470 --> 15:10.140
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

15:07.830 --> 15:08.870
it's not appropriate to enter

15:08.870 --> 15:10.360
a man's home barefoot.

15:10.170 --> 15:13.230
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

15:12.150 --> 15:13.320
I remembered that.

15:14.680 --> 15:18.290
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

15:15.120 --> 15:16.960
How many men did you drink with to get this drunk?

15:18.320 --> 15:21.350
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

15:19.440 --> 15:21.960
It was the landlady who told me to remember that.

15:22.600 --> 15:24.240
Do you know the landlady?

15:22.800 --> 15:24.800
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

15:24.830 --> 15:26.830
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

15:26.150 --> 15:26.750
Ji Tanyin,

15:26.750 --> 15:27.960
I'm going to drop you,

15:27.610 --> 15:31.120
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

15:27.960 --> 15:28.600
you know?

15:28.600 --> 15:29.960
I know it.

15:30.510 --> 15:32.600
You definitely don't know her.

15:31.540 --> 15:33.540
♫If between oaths♫

15:33.820 --> 15:35.630
♫I hold onto the longing for just one more glance♫

15:35.650 --> 15:39.050
♫Unwilling to bid farewell for good♫

15:38.000 --> 15:39.750
The landlady is getting married.

15:40.280 --> 15:41.590
She's quite busy.

15:40.330 --> 15:42.330
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

15:42.350 --> 15:44.320
♫Longing fades in half♫

15:42.440 --> 15:44.150
She needs to renovate a house

15:44.510 --> 15:49.310
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

15:45.510 --> 15:47.030
and then make furniture.

15:47.870 --> 15:49.480
Once the furniture is done,

15:49.790 --> 15:52.630
there will be a lot of things to do.

15:49.840 --> 15:57.110
♫A thousand years of long nights, yearning from dawn to dusk♫

15:55.720 --> 15:56.550
Yuanzhong,

15:57.680 --> 15:59.680
let's build a house too.

16:21.320 --> 16:22.190
Yuanzhong,

16:23.340 --> 16:25.300
let's build a house too.

16:28.470 --> 16:29.280
Ji Tanyin.

16:29.870 --> 16:30.670
Ji Tanyin!

16:31.390 --> 16:32.270
So noisy.

16:32.870 --> 16:34.000
Ji Tanyin, wake up.

16:34.550 --> 16:35.390
Wake up.

16:40.360 --> 16:41.240
I'm telling you,

16:41.510 --> 16:42.670
I will never

16:42.670 --> 16:43.720
build a house with you.

16:43.720 --> 16:44.840
Do you understand?

16:44.910 --> 16:46.320
You're just a handmaiden.

16:46.320 --> 16:47.960
I can discard you at any time.

16:47.960 --> 16:48.960
Do you understand?

17:02.790 --> 17:06.250
[Yesterday's Inn]

17:18.200 --> 17:19.030
Yuanzhong,

17:20.170 --> 17:22.170
let's build a house too.

17:37.480 --> 17:38.160
Madam,

17:38.160 --> 17:39.350
could you pick a necklace for me?

17:39.590 --> 17:40.310
I want to give it as a gift.

17:40.310 --> 17:41.270
This one.

17:41.270 --> 17:42.590
Your wife will definitely like it.

17:42.590 --> 17:43.440
This one?

17:43.590 --> 17:45.110
Look, look at its quality.

17:45.110 --> 17:45.830
Madam, how much is this bracelet?

17:45.960 --> 17:47.400
how much is this bracelet?

17:47.400 --> 17:48.590
Please wait a moment.

18:05.750 --> 18:06.560
Captain.

18:11.140 --> 18:12.100
Lyu Yao

18:12.350 --> 18:13.310
still isn't here yet?

18:14.270 --> 18:15.030
She always makes us wait

18:15.030 --> 18:16.350
for hours.

18:16.350 --> 18:17.510
So arrogant.

18:17.860 --> 18:20.560
[Qing Yu]
[War Demon]

18:18.590 --> 18:19.960
Once we return to the battlefield,

18:20.440 --> 18:21.920
both she and that Wushuang Society

18:21.920 --> 18:22.750
will have to die.

18:29.310 --> 18:30.510
Things are different now.

18:30.930 --> 18:32.130
Qian Lin's whereabouts are unknown,

18:32.690 --> 18:33.970
and we are the ones who need her.

18:34.100 --> 18:35.530
We'd better not be so impatient.

18:41.760 --> 18:42.450
Sir, please enjoy.

18:42.470 --> 18:43.670
Let me know if you need anything.

18:47.200 --> 18:48.000
Young Master.

18:48.310 --> 18:49.590
We found traces of the War Demons.

18:49.590 --> 18:50.920
Jiuguang has already gone after them.

19:06.660 --> 19:08.340
The stinking fox's scent has disappeared.

19:10.670 --> 19:11.950
Who are you calling a stinking fox?

19:13.720 --> 19:14.510
Young Master.

19:15.960 --> 19:16.760
This way.

19:26.910 --> 19:28.460
I'll ask you one more time.

19:28.720 --> 19:30.680
How did you escape from the prison?

19:31.440 --> 19:34.400
And what is your relationship with Wushuang Society?

19:34.940 --> 19:36.210
I'll answer you one more time.

19:37.820 --> 19:39.250
I have nothing to tell you.

19:39.400 --> 19:40.480
Don't tell me

19:41.010 --> 19:42.690
you're still holding onto some hope.

19:43.750 --> 19:45.000
Let me make it clear.

19:45.440 --> 19:47.270
If you don't confess everything today,

19:47.610 --> 19:49.330
you won't be leaving this place.

19:50.530 --> 19:51.850
Why waste words?

19:52.110 --> 19:53.960
Are these henchmen of yours just for show?

19:54.480 --> 19:55.680
Just torture me already.

19:55.880 --> 19:57.030
You think we don't dare to do anything to you?

19:57.030 --> 19:57.720
Stop.

20:00.330 --> 20:01.770
I know you're not afraid of death,

20:02.200 --> 20:03.240
but I advise you

20:04.030 --> 20:05.310
to think it through.

20:05.880 --> 20:06.680
I...

20:07.050 --> 20:08.530
will only give you one chance.

20:11.000 --> 20:11.750
Do you know why

20:11.750 --> 20:13.160
I haven't made a move on you yet?

20:13.790 --> 20:14.790
Because right now,

20:15.000 --> 20:16.720
it's me standing in front of you.

20:17.160 --> 20:18.640
If it were someone else,

20:19.230 --> 20:20.670
you'd already be facing

20:21.760 --> 20:24.170
godlike methods by now.

20:27.480 --> 20:28.400
It's the War Demons.

20:32.510 --> 20:33.310
How is it?

20:33.880 --> 20:34.790
They're all inside.

20:35.440 --> 20:36.350
Have you scouted it out thoroughly?

20:36.830 --> 20:37.880
We can take action at any time.

20:41.240 --> 20:42.030
Let's go.

20:43.250 --> 20:43.930
It looks like

20:43.960 --> 20:45.370
they're going to harm the people in the temple.

20:46.030 --> 20:47.270
It might be a trap.

20:47.350 --> 20:48.270
To prevent any tricks,

20:48.680 --> 20:49.830
let's hold our position for now.

20:50.000 --> 20:50.790
Yes.

20:53.200 --> 20:54.000
Who are you?

20:58.200 --> 20:59.200
Leave the woman.

20:59.510 --> 21:00.320
As for the others,

21:00.350 --> 21:00.980
kill them!

21:14.390 --> 21:15.190
Zhi Dai?

21:24.060 --> 21:24.860
Young Master.

21:53.720 --> 21:55.270
It's not about being early but being timely.

21:56.400 --> 21:57.880
Since you're insisting on throwing your life away,

21:57.900 --> 21:59.140
then don't blame me.

22:00.010 --> 22:01.100
You knew something was off,

22:01.350 --> 22:02.480
so why did you come in?

22:02.480 --> 22:03.510
You've protected me for many years.

22:03.880 --> 22:05.270
It's time for me to repay you.

22:05.850 --> 22:07.040
Master and servant saving each other, huh?

22:07.090 --> 22:08.540
What a cheesy scene.

22:09.960 --> 22:11.240
Kill them now!

22:30.550 --> 22:31.720
Youhu people?

22:34.170 --> 22:34.960
Die!

23:09.390 --> 23:10.830
Anyone who stands in my way will die!

23:22.050 --> 23:23.020
Young Master!

23:25.930 --> 23:26.880
No!

23:36.170 --> 23:37.330
Mr. Tanghua!

23:37.960 --> 23:38.750
Young Master!

23:39.070 --> 23:39.880
Young Master!

23:47.270 --> 23:48.070
Tanghua!

23:50.160 --> 23:50.960
Retreat!

23:56.960 --> 23:57.660
Young Master!

23:57.890 --> 23:58.690
Tanghua!

23:59.350 --> 24:00.160
Young Master.

24:01.720 --> 24:02.510
Jiuguang...

24:03.170 --> 24:05.560
chase them. Chase them!

24:09.790 --> 24:10.920
Dying like this

24:12.030 --> 24:13.310
isn't too bad.

24:13.410 --> 24:14.270
You're talking nonsense!

24:14.270 --> 24:15.270
Mr. Tanghua.

24:15.640 --> 24:16.720
You won't die!

24:16.720 --> 24:18.070
I won't let you die!

24:18.570 --> 24:19.680
Shen Ying, quick!

24:19.830 --> 24:21.110
Take my horse and find a cart

24:21.130 --> 24:22.500
to bring him back to the mansion for treatment.

24:22.670 --> 24:23.460
Yes.

24:24.920 --> 24:25.720
Tanghua.

24:26.300 --> 24:27.200
Tanghua.

26:14.880 --> 26:16.070
Yuanzhong, over here.

26:18.750 --> 26:19.880
What's going on

26:19.880 --> 26:21.070
this early in the morning?

26:22.610 --> 26:23.400
Si.

26:24.350 --> 26:25.960
Why are you so flustered too?

26:26.240 --> 26:27.270
That guy woke up,

26:27.270 --> 26:28.790
but he's just staring blankly and not speaking.

26:28.810 --> 26:30.200
I'm afraid he might have injured his brain.

26:30.430 --> 26:31.630
I need to find a doctor.

26:35.270 --> 26:36.600
You don't even know where you live.

26:36.620 --> 26:38.050
Do you remember who your parents are?

26:39.030 --> 26:40.400
Have you gone dumb?

26:47.720 --> 26:49.070
You remember me, right?

26:49.480 --> 26:51.200
We met once on the tower ship.

26:51.240 --> 26:52.400
You came to ask me for directions.

26:52.400 --> 26:53.480
Do you remember?

26:58.110 --> 26:59.920
Did you get injured on the tower ship?

26:59.960 --> 27:01.270
Where are your companions?

27:01.480 --> 27:02.590
What's your name?

27:02.720 --> 27:04.110
He's probably mute.

27:09.880 --> 27:10.750
My name is Qian Lin.

27:14.790 --> 27:15.880
My name is Ji Tanyin.

27:15.880 --> 27:16.790
This is San.

27:16.790 --> 27:18.200
And there's another one called Si.

27:18.220 --> 27:19.780
They're the ones who saved you and brought you back.

27:19.960 --> 27:21.270
She's the one who paid for your room.

27:21.270 --> 27:21.720
Otherwise,

27:21.720 --> 27:23.040
you would've been thrown out already.

27:24.030 --> 27:25.350
Look, how kind she is.

27:25.350 --> 27:26.590
She even made you a straw mat.

27:26.590 --> 27:27.480
She was afraid that if you lay there all the time,

27:27.480 --> 27:28.510
your back would rot.

27:28.970 --> 27:29.860
It's nothing.

27:29.960 --> 27:30.830
How are you feeling now?

27:30.830 --> 27:31.960
You feel better, right?

27:36.720 --> 27:37.960
My things are missing.

27:38.080 --> 27:39.190
Have you seen them?

27:40.110 --> 27:41.400
They're with our landlady.

27:41.430 --> 27:41.950
When she comes back,

27:41.970 --> 27:43.000
you can ask her for them yourself.

28:00.240 --> 28:01.160
Who is it?

28:05.310 --> 28:06.110
Master?

28:08.160 --> 28:08.830
It's so early in the morning.

28:08.830 --> 28:10.110
What brings you here?

28:11.270 --> 28:12.590
I heard you renovated your house.

28:14.790 --> 28:16.510
Well, I'm about to get married.

28:16.510 --> 28:17.480
So I thought

28:17.480 --> 28:19.030
I'd renovate this old house of mine.

28:19.160 --> 28:19.950
Master, look.

28:20.480 --> 28:21.900
That porch, those windows,

28:22.070 --> 28:23.030
and the roof—

28:23.300 --> 28:24.410
they're all things I've recently renovated.

28:25.640 --> 28:27.310
Master, let's go inside and have a seat.

28:27.880 --> 28:28.680
Alright.

28:30.160 --> 28:31.070
Master, please come in.

28:31.510 --> 28:33.240
Once the new furniture is in place,

28:33.240 --> 28:34.700
this house will look brand new.

28:38.400 --> 28:39.400
Master, please have a seat.

28:42.880 --> 28:43.680
How do you like it?

28:45.680 --> 28:46.480
Not bad.

28:48.920 --> 28:49.790
What's this?

28:50.480 --> 28:51.310
Well, this house

28:51.310 --> 28:52.200
just got renovated.

28:52.200 --> 28:53.830
A new house should have a god's image hung up.

28:54.680 --> 28:56.080
This is the image of the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain

28:56.200 --> 28:57.480
I invited here.

28:58.550 --> 28:59.350
Master,

29:00.000 --> 29:01.110
since you're here,

29:01.110 --> 29:02.240
could you help me

29:02.400 --> 29:03.160
figure out

29:03.160 --> 29:04.350
where to hang this image?

29:04.550 --> 29:05.720
This Mute Lady of Wu Mountain

29:08.350 --> 29:09.880
has a lot of things with her.

29:10.440 --> 29:11.240
Master.

29:12.550 --> 29:13.640
These are the Mute Goddess's

29:13.640 --> 29:14.720
three magical treasures—

29:14.720 --> 29:16.750
a divine whip that cannot be destroyed,

29:16.880 --> 29:18.510
a phoenix that soars in the sky,

29:18.880 --> 29:19.590
and

29:19.590 --> 29:21.350
a treasure bag that can carry all things.

29:29.510 --> 29:30.510
Is this the thing you were in a hurry

29:30.510 --> 29:31.440
to get back?

29:32.270 --> 29:33.070
Exactly.

29:33.310 --> 29:34.270
Thank you, Madam.

29:40.870 --> 29:42.150
So sharp.

29:42.640 --> 29:43.750
You tried my dagger?

29:44.110 --> 29:45.510
I meant your eyes.

29:46.830 --> 29:48.750
When you were lying down,

29:48.750 --> 29:50.180
you looked so gentle and harmless.

29:50.470 --> 29:53.230
But now that you've woken up, your eyes are like a drawn sword.

29:53.270 --> 29:54.070
Young people,

29:54.960 --> 29:55.720
showing your sharpness and aggressiveness

29:55.720 --> 29:57.400
isn't always a good thing.

30:00.480 --> 30:01.790
Thank you for your advice, Madam.

30:02.270 --> 30:03.590
And thank you for taking care of me these days.

30:04.240 --> 30:05.400
Looking after you is not quite right.

30:05.400 --> 30:06.750
After all, I was paid for it.

30:06.790 --> 30:08.400
If you really want to thank me,

30:08.490 --> 30:09.860
leave here as soon as possible.

30:10.240 --> 30:12.070
I've been in business for a long time,

30:12.070 --> 30:13.620
so I've developed a keen eye for people.

30:14.400 --> 30:16.160
I'm never wrong about people.

30:17.110 --> 30:18.070
Once you're healed, leave quickly

30:18.070 --> 30:18.720
and don't bring trouble

30:18.720 --> 30:19.830
to my inn.

30:30.920 --> 30:31.590
Tanyin.

30:32.350 --> 30:33.400
What are you carrying?

30:33.830 --> 30:35.640
It's some food for the patient.

30:35.640 --> 30:36.400
Patient?

30:36.510 --> 30:37.920
We don't have any patients here.

30:37.920 --> 30:39.110
It's for the person inside.

30:40.070 --> 30:41.160
That guy has woken up,

30:41.160 --> 30:42.540
so he's no longer a patient.

30:42.790 --> 30:43.920
Aren't you busy today?

30:44.510 --> 30:45.310
It's alright.

30:45.310 --> 30:46.070
Then I'll send...

30:46.070 --> 30:47.410
I've told you there's no need to check on him.

30:47.590 --> 30:48.590
You're a young girl,

30:48.590 --> 30:49.510
and it's not appropriate for you

30:49.510 --> 30:50.510
to keep running to his room.

30:50.510 --> 30:51.590
He's recovered now.

30:51.640 --> 30:52.820
Let me see what you've brought.

30:55.030 --> 30:56.400
It's all my favorite food.

30:57.000 --> 30:58.350
You are rare here. I'll make some tea,

30:58.350 --> 30:59.350
and let's chat for a while.

30:59.370 --> 31:00.160
-Let's go.
-Wait...

31:00.660 --> 31:01.640
Come on, come on.

31:05.930 --> 31:06.690
You asked me to look into

31:06.720 --> 31:08.160
Baitou Mountain, and I've got something.

31:08.540 --> 31:09.930
Xie You is quite famous,

31:10.160 --> 31:11.680
which matches what Ji Tanyin said.

31:11.790 --> 31:12.720
He once trained two students

31:12.720 --> 31:14.480
with high reputations.

31:14.510 --> 31:15.720
One of them is Goddess Wushuang,

31:15.720 --> 31:17.270
who has ascended and is now a god.

31:17.510 --> 31:19.400
The other is the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

31:19.480 --> 31:20.440
She hasn't ascended,

31:20.440 --> 31:22.200
but her reputation among the human race is also quite high.

31:22.480 --> 31:23.680
She's the one who took your blow

31:23.680 --> 31:25.410
during the Battle of Pinghu.

31:27.920 --> 31:29.070
These are the Mute Goddess's

31:29.070 --> 31:30.210
three magical treasures—

31:30.240 --> 31:32.270
a divine whip that cannot be destroyed,

31:32.400 --> 31:34.030
a phoenix that soars in the sky,

31:34.270 --> 31:35.030
and

31:35.030 --> 31:36.750
a treasure bag that can carry all things.

31:42.320 --> 31:43.670
Of course it's true.

31:43.750 --> 31:45.270
The doctor said he's recovered.

31:45.550 --> 31:46.310
Even if you don't trust me,

31:46.310 --> 31:47.400
don't you trust the doctor?

31:47.590 --> 31:49.030
Anyway, don't see him anymore.

31:49.030 --> 31:49.920
Just listen to me.

31:50.960 --> 31:52.110
Why can't I see him?

31:53.220 --> 31:54.170
Anyway...

31:56.160 --> 31:57.720
Mr. Yuan, you're back?

31:57.920 --> 31:58.960
Where have you been?

32:03.790 --> 32:04.830
Just wandered around.

32:08.310 --> 32:09.200
That painting...

32:10.400 --> 32:11.090
What about it?

32:14.510 --> 32:16.160
I saw a similar one at Pei Jiu's house.

32:16.590 --> 32:18.030
The portrait of the Mute Goddess

32:18.030 --> 32:19.320
was also invited here by me,

32:19.440 --> 32:20.880
to pray for Pei Jiu's safety.

32:23.480 --> 32:24.790
It seems that the people in this town

32:25.350 --> 32:26.760
all believe in the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

32:27.400 --> 32:28.640
Of course.

32:29.270 --> 32:30.480
When you entered the town,

32:30.590 --> 32:32.150
didn't you see the stone at the entrance?

32:32.310 --> 32:33.110
What?

32:34.440 --> 32:35.240
This big,

32:35.640 --> 32:36.440
and this tall.

32:36.610 --> 32:37.780
Maybe even taller.

32:38.200 --> 32:40.110
It's right at the entrance, with the words "Turn Back" written on it.

32:41.400 --> 32:42.550
Did you not see the Evil-abandoning Tree

32:42.550 --> 32:43.480
in the east of the town as well?

32:43.500 --> 32:44.630
Does it have words written on it too?

32:45.200 --> 32:46.270
Well, no.

32:46.680 --> 32:47.330
Anyway,

32:47.360 --> 32:48.680
it's a very large tree.

32:48.920 --> 32:49.790
It's said that, back then,

32:49.790 --> 32:51.200
37 people sat under that tree,

32:51.200 --> 32:51.880
and none of them

32:51.880 --> 32:53.160
were outside the shade.

32:53.180 --> 32:54.620
Can you imagine how big the tree is?

32:56.510 --> 32:58.070
Madam, what exactly are you trying to say?

32:59.240 --> 33:00.750
I won't keep you guessing.

33:00.770 --> 33:02.770
What I'm telling you is not just the history of this town,

33:02.800 --> 33:04.120
but also its connection

33:04.140 --> 33:05.620
to the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

33:05.960 --> 33:06.680
Originally,

33:06.680 --> 33:07.680
this place was a bandit den,

33:07.680 --> 33:08.640
called Black Water Stronghold.

33:08.870 --> 33:10.510
As you know, bandits are notorious

33:10.510 --> 33:11.550
for doing all kinds of evil

33:11.550 --> 33:12.640
and wreaking havoc everywhere.

33:12.660 --> 33:13.480
The surrounding villagers

33:13.480 --> 33:15.270
had suffered from them for many years.

33:15.350 --> 33:16.230
But these bandits

33:16.230 --> 33:17.240
were highly skilled.

33:17.310 --> 33:18.070
Each of the chiefs

33:18.070 --> 33:19.070
possessed extraordinary abilities

33:19.070 --> 33:20.070
and was ruthless.

33:20.550 --> 33:21.480
For a time,

33:21.480 --> 33:23.350
even the authorities had no idea how to deal with them.

33:23.510 --> 33:24.310
And then?

33:25.110 --> 33:27.160
Then, the Mute Goddess of Wu Mountain

33:27.160 --> 33:28.160
stepped in.

33:28.440 --> 33:30.000
Upon learning about the bandit problem here,

33:30.030 --> 33:31.550
she came without hesitation

33:31.550 --> 33:32.720
to enlighten them.

33:33.350 --> 33:34.160
Enlighten?

33:34.960 --> 33:35.790
There are two kinds of enlightenment—

33:35.790 --> 33:37.680
one through kindness, and the other through force.

33:37.750 --> 33:38.550
Kindness

33:38.550 --> 33:39.830
works on good people,

33:39.830 --> 33:40.590
but when facing

33:40.590 --> 33:42.160
evil people who refuse to listen,

33:42.440 --> 33:43.200
it all comes down to

33:43.200 --> 33:44.790
whose fist is stronger.

33:45.220 --> 33:46.700
So that's what you call enlightening through force.

33:46.880 --> 33:48.720
Exactly. It's said that

33:48.720 --> 33:50.200
the Goddess beat them terribly back then.

33:50.200 --> 33:50.880
Not only that,

33:50.880 --> 33:52.160
but she dragged them under the tree and lectured them

33:52.160 --> 33:53.680
for three days and three nights

33:53.920 --> 33:55.070
until all 36 chiefs

33:55.070 --> 33:56.880
were fully convinced.

33:57.750 --> 33:59.550
She didn't just defeat them physically—she broke their spirits too?

33:59.830 --> 34:01.110
The Mute Goddess

34:02.030 --> 34:04.030
is truly ruthless.

34:04.110 --> 34:04.830
How else

34:04.830 --> 34:06.270
can you deal with evildoers without being ruthless?

34:06.790 --> 34:07.780
After that,

34:07.920 --> 34:09.320
the Black Water Stronghold disbanded—

34:09.320 --> 34:10.030
some left,

34:10.030 --> 34:11.030
while some stayed.

34:11.030 --> 34:11.480
But

34:11.480 --> 34:12.800
no one committed crimes anymore.

34:12.840 --> 34:13.880
They settled down, married,

34:13.880 --> 34:15.480
and lived peaceful lives ever after.

34:15.760 --> 34:17.110
To remember this event

34:17.110 --> 34:18.070
and serve as a warning to future generations,

34:18.070 --> 34:19.030
they erected the Turning Back Stone

34:19.030 --> 34:20.280
at the town entrance,

34:20.440 --> 34:22.030
symbolizing that it's never too late

34:22.030 --> 34:23.280
for a lost soul to turn back.

34:24.550 --> 34:26.000
This event happened hundreds of years ago.

34:26.000 --> 34:27.550
People come and go in this town,

34:27.550 --> 34:29.070
and the name "Black Water Stronghold"

34:29.070 --> 34:30.480
is almost forgotten by everyone.

34:30.480 --> 34:31.590
Only that stone remains,

34:31.590 --> 34:32.840
standing there without budging.

34:33.030 --> 34:35.150
Isn't that a clear testament

34:35.150 --> 34:36.710
to the Goddess' achievements?

34:39.370 --> 34:40.600
It certainly is,

34:40.929 --> 34:42.600
and it's very obvious.

34:44.110 --> 34:45.630
Even I didn't notice it.

34:46.139 --> 34:48.280
That's why it's only natural

34:48.280 --> 34:49.480
that we honor the Goddess.

34:49.550 --> 34:51.000
You've only seen a few households.

34:51.000 --> 34:52.110
If you're curious,

34:52.110 --> 34:53.159
you can go from house to house,

34:53.190 --> 34:54.620
and you can see that every family worships the Goddess.

34:55.920 --> 34:57.110
Is that so?

34:58.280 --> 34:59.800
Looks like the Mute Goddess

34:59.920 --> 35:01.670
is truly a celestial being who descended to the world

35:01.810 --> 35:03.210
to save all beings.

35:04.110 --> 35:04.920
Ji Tanyin,

35:06.510 --> 35:07.440
what do you think?

35:12.510 --> 35:13.480
Since that's the case,

35:14.480 --> 35:15.320
we absolutely must not

35:15.320 --> 35:16.590
be disrespectful.

35:17.840 --> 35:18.630
Madam,

35:19.190 --> 35:21.030
could you sell me some incense?

35:21.400 --> 35:22.510
I'd like to pay my respects too.

35:22.710 --> 35:23.800
Oh, don't be silly.

35:23.800 --> 35:25.440
I don't make money from just anything.

35:25.550 --> 35:26.720
If you want to pay respects to the Goddess,

35:26.760 --> 35:28.320
I can't possibly take your money.

35:29.000 --> 35:29.960
Please, go ahead.

35:49.550 --> 35:50.960
Mute Goddess,

35:51.840 --> 35:53.590
I, a mere mortal, Yuanzhong,

35:53.900 --> 35:55.130
am offering incense to you

35:55.800 --> 35:57.280
and praying for your blessings.

35:58.320 --> 35:59.360
Remember to pray for wealth.

35:59.360 --> 36:00.670
Praying for wealth is very effective.

36:04.480 --> 36:07.400
First, I pray for your protection over me,

36:08.150 --> 36:09.480
to discern loyalty and treachery

36:10.510 --> 36:11.880
when making friends,

36:12.400 --> 36:15.880
and not to be deceived by false hypocrites.

36:23.760 --> 36:26.630
Second, I pray for you to bless me

36:26.630 --> 36:28.000
with a smooth path in life,

36:28.270 --> 36:29.580
allowing me to come and go freely,

36:30.630 --> 36:34.000
and to be free from the traps of hypocrisy and deceit.

36:36.280 --> 36:39.150
Third, I pray for you to bless me

36:39.880 --> 36:41.150
with good fortune,

36:41.670 --> 36:43.030
to avoid disasters,

36:43.320 --> 36:46.630
and to keep me safe from all my old and new enemies and foes

36:46.960 --> 36:48.440
with honeyed words but evil intentions.

37:01.840 --> 37:03.070
Goddess, may you show your divine power.

37:29.670 --> 37:31.280
I am severely injured now

37:31.920 --> 37:33.510
and definitely no match for them.

37:34.280 --> 37:35.400
If I want to make it,

37:36.090 --> 37:37.700
I need to wait for the right moment and use wisdom to win.

38:03.510 --> 38:05.400
I, Li Chaoyang, Chief of the War Demons,

38:05.480 --> 38:06.710
greet you, Goddess.

38:08.400 --> 38:09.630
Let me ask you,

38:10.150 --> 38:11.800
have the things I entrusted to you

38:12.440 --> 38:13.960
been fully prepared?

38:16.670 --> 38:17.550
Goddess,

38:18.230 --> 38:19.480
everything has been prepared

38:19.480 --> 38:20.480
according to your instructions,

38:20.800 --> 38:21.880
without any mistakes.

38:28.630 --> 38:30.960
Ji Tanyin is her real name.

38:31.590 --> 38:33.360
Her birth date is on the paper.

38:33.710 --> 38:35.760
Tomorrow is her birthday.

38:36.950 --> 38:38.070
There must be no mistakes.

38:38.510 --> 38:39.190
Yes.

38:42.840 --> 38:43.630
Yuanzhong.

38:47.440 --> 38:48.230
Yuanzhong?

38:49.110 --> 38:50.150
I made noodles.

38:50.150 --> 38:51.400
Come out and eat with me.

38:58.710 --> 38:59.510
What's wrong?

38:59.800 --> 39:01.070
I came to call Yuanzhong for noodles,

39:01.070 --> 39:02.230
but he's not opening the door.

39:02.630 --> 39:03.760
He must have gone out.

39:03.760 --> 39:05.320
But I didn't see him leave.

39:05.400 --> 39:06.400
Go and have some rest.

39:06.400 --> 39:07.200
I'll go find him.

39:19.760 --> 39:21.280
Yuanzhong, it's me.

39:28.840 --> 39:30.030
I knew you were here.

39:30.190 --> 39:31.150
Why didn't you open the door?

39:31.150 --> 39:31.960
I have no appetite.

39:32.030 --> 39:32.680
I'm not hungry.

39:33.960 --> 39:34.760
Not hungry?

39:36.390 --> 39:37.920
Is there a big secret

39:37.920 --> 39:39.190
that you can only tell me?

39:41.110 --> 39:42.230
From now on,

39:42.320 --> 39:43.360
everything about me

39:43.360 --> 39:44.320
is a secret,

39:44.530 --> 39:46.010
especially to Ji Tanyin.

39:46.550 --> 39:47.360
Why?

39:47.360 --> 39:47.880
Haven't we already known

39:47.880 --> 39:49.360
that something's wrong with her?

39:50.150 --> 39:51.670
But hasn't she already...

39:51.670 --> 39:53.070
She's the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain.

39:53.590 --> 39:54.400
What?

39:54.800 --> 39:56.110
How is that possible?

39:56.230 --> 39:57.070
Are you shocked?

39:57.260 --> 39:58.610
I was even more shocked than you are.

39:59.000 --> 40:00.360
I originally thought she was just...

40:01.230 --> 40:02.510
I knew there was something wrong with her.

40:02.840 --> 40:04.360
I knew she had ulterior motives.

40:04.360 --> 40:05.590
I knew her deliberately approaching

40:05.590 --> 40:06.880
was certainly not with good intentions!

40:07.190 --> 40:08.150
I should have realized it earlier.

40:08.150 --> 40:09.110
I should have thought of it.

40:09.110 --> 40:10.330
I should have awakened to it sooner!

40:10.630 --> 40:11.440
Yuanzhong,

40:11.960 --> 40:13.480
there's no need to be so agitated.

40:14.510 --> 40:15.510
Am I agitated?

40:15.510 --> 40:16.230
Which one of your eyes

40:16.230 --> 40:17.110
saw me being agitated?

40:17.230 --> 40:18.150
I'm happy.

40:18.150 --> 40:19.590
I can't be happy enough.

40:19.610 --> 40:20.940
Now that we've exposed her,

40:21.230 --> 40:22.320
what should we do next?

40:24.110 --> 40:24.920
Indeed,

40:25.670 --> 40:26.400
I don't know why

40:26.400 --> 40:27.400
Ji Tanyin appeared

40:27.400 --> 40:28.840
by your side either,

40:29.070 --> 40:30.550
but we've been with her for so long—

40:30.960 --> 40:33.150
from Fangwai Mountain to the tower ship,

40:33.480 --> 40:34.440
to Baitou Mountain,

40:34.880 --> 40:36.440
and now to Orange Lake.

40:36.880 --> 40:38.760
It's been quite a journey.

40:40.000 --> 40:41.710
I don't think she has any ill intentions.

40:42.510 --> 40:43.320
At least,

40:44.300 --> 40:45.970
she's genuinely been protecting you.

40:50.480 --> 40:51.280
However,

40:53.280 --> 40:54.760
whether she's good or bad,

40:55.000 --> 40:56.840
and no matter what her intentions are,

40:56.960 --> 40:57.800
I feel that

40:58.190 --> 40:59.070
she is no longer suitable

40:59.070 --> 41:00.320
to stay by your side.

41:01.150 --> 41:01.960
Because

41:02.440 --> 41:04.110
she will disturb your mind,

41:04.400 --> 41:05.230
or perhaps,

41:06.320 --> 41:08.030
she already has.

41:08.360 --> 41:10.320
Yuanzhong, this can't go on.

41:11.320 --> 41:12.190
She will interfere

41:12.190 --> 41:13.880
with what we need to do next.

41:30.880 --> 41:31.670
Miss Ji.

41:34.590 --> 41:35.590
Have your injuries healed?

41:37.000 --> 41:37.800
Thank you for your concern.

41:37.880 --> 41:38.860
It's no longer a problem.

41:42.670 --> 41:43.550
What are you doing?

41:44.360 --> 41:45.840
I'm making a cabinet.

41:46.100 --> 41:47.360
The landlady is getting married.

41:47.440 --> 41:48.230
It's a gift for her.

41:49.510 --> 41:50.840
Miss, you're really kind.

41:50.880 --> 41:52.110
We're friends, after all.

41:52.230 --> 41:53.030
Friends?

41:53.880 --> 41:54.760
I thought

41:54.960 --> 41:56.630
you were just guests at the inn.

41:58.110 --> 41:59.110
Can't a guest and the owner

41:59.150 --> 42:00.430
be friends?

42:01.400 --> 42:02.320
Of course they can.

42:02.440 --> 42:05.230
It's just that most people come and go in a hurry,

42:05.230 --> 42:06.230
just passing by,

42:06.590 --> 42:07.800
making it hard to make true friends.

42:10.630 --> 42:11.440
Miss Ji,

42:12.440 --> 42:13.920
are you planning to stay here for a long time?

42:13.920 --> 42:15.000
Why did you come here?

42:15.550 --> 42:17.190
Are you here visiting family and friends...

42:18.420 --> 42:19.230
or just traveling?

42:22.880 --> 42:23.920
Miss, please don't get me wrong.

42:24.260 --> 42:25.260
The reason I asked

42:25.290 --> 42:27.930
is because you've covered

42:27.950 --> 42:28.910
many of my expenses.

42:29.230 --> 42:30.800
I don't have any money at the moment,

42:31.030 --> 42:32.470
and I thought if you're planning to stay here for a long time,

42:32.630 --> 42:34.280
it would be easier for me to pay you back.

42:34.340 --> 42:35.490
Is that the reason?

42:37.170 --> 42:39.170
It's fine. You don't need to pay me back.

42:39.230 --> 42:40.070
How could I?

42:40.320 --> 42:41.670
Yuanzhong is very wealthy.

42:41.670 --> 42:42.960
Using his money to help you

42:42.980 --> 42:44.360
would probably make him happy too.
